TASK FEAT74
	TITLE "Pick a world object by its label in a catalogue filtered on the name typed"
	STATUS draft
	SPEC "the catalogue lists the 652 rows of the world object label table and keeps the rows whose"
		+ "label or world object name carries the fragment typed"
